OL,4,CEnergy price increase 'could put me in 
OL,5,Chospital'                              
OL,6,GA hike in energy costs in the new year 
OL,7,Ghas prompted concerns many families    
OL,8,Gwill see a hard winter.                
OL,10,FEnergy bills are expected to increase  
OL,11,Fby 26% from January after a surge in   
OL,12,Fgas prices sparked by the Iran war,    
OL,13,Fwith the government saying it will pay 
OL,14,Fmillions of households #100 from 4     
OL,15,FJanuary to help cover winter costs on  
OL,16,Ftop of an existing VAT cut on          
OL,17,Felectricity.                           
OL,19,FHowever, residents in Stockton-on-Tees 
OL,20,Fand Darlington said that was not       
OL,21,Fenough to mitigate the rise of about   
OL,22,F#440 annually.                         
